<div
  x-data
  class="shrink-0">
  <button
    type="button"
    @click="$refs.recommendationDialog.showModal()"
    aria-label="AI 책 추천 열기"
    aria-haspopup="dialog"
    aria-controls="book-recommendation-dialog"
    class="inline-flex h-11 shrink-0 cursor-pointer items-center gap-1 rounded-full border-none bg-[#e9e4d9] px-2.5 text-xs font-semibold text-[#76502d] transition hover:text-stone-950 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-stone-500">
    <span
      class="i-lucide-sparkles h-4 w-4"
      aria-hidden="true"></span>
    AI 도서 추천
  </button>
  <dialog
    id="book-recommendation-dialog"
    x-ref="recommendationDialog"
    aria-labelledby="book-recommendation-title"
    @click="if ($event.target === $el) $el.close()"
    class="m-auto max-h-[90dvh] w-[calc(100%-2rem)] max-w-xl overflow-hidden rounded-[1.5rem] border-none bg-[#fffdf8] p-0 text-stone-950 shadow-xl backdrop:bg-stone-950/35">
    <div
      class="flex max-h-[90dvh] flex-col"
      @click.stop>
      <div class="flex shrink-0 items-start justify-between gap-3 px-5 pt-5 pb-3">
        <div>
          <h2
            id="book-recommendation-title"
            class="m-0 flex items-center gap-2 text-xl font-semibold">
            <span
              class="i-lucide-sparkles h-5 w-5 text-[#9e6125]"
              aria-hidden="true"></span>
            어떤 책을 읽을까요?
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-2 mb-0 text-sm leading-6 break-keep text-stone-500">
            지금 끌리는 분위기나 관심 있는 주제를 알려 주세요.
          </p>
        </div>
        <button
          type="button"
          @click="$refs.recommendationDialog.close()"
          aria-label="책 추천 닫기"
          class="inline-flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 cursor-pointer items-center justify-center rounded-full border-none bg-[#f7f2e8] text-stone-700">
          <span
            class="i-lucide-x h-4 w-4"
            aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </button>
      </div>
      <div class="min-h-0 overflow-y-auto overscroll-contain px-5 pb-5">
        <form
          method="post"
          action="/xapi/books/recommend"
          hx-post="/xapi/books/recommend"
          hx-target="#book-recommendation-results"
          hx-swap="innerHTML"
          hx-request='{"timeout":120000}'
          hx-disabled-elt="find button[type='submit']"
          x-data="{ busy: false, requestFailed: false }"
          @htmx:before-request="busy = true; requestFailed = false"
          @htmx:after-request="busy = false; requestFailed = !$event.detail.successful"
          :aria-busy="busy"
          class="flex flex-col gap-4">
          <input
            type="hidden"
            name="from"
            value="<%= fromPath %>" />
          <label class="block space-y-2">
            <span class="block text-sm font-medium text-stone-700">읽고 싶은 책</span>
            <textarea
              name="preference"
              required
              maxlength="500"
              rows="3"
              placeholder="예: 짧고 몰입감 있는 추리소설을 읽고 싶어요."
              class="box-border block w-full resize-y rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 bg-[#fbf7ef] px-4 py-3 [font-family:inherit] text-base leading-6 text-stone-900 outline-none focus:border-stone-500"></textarea>
          </label>
          <p class="m-0 text-xs leading-5 break-keep text-stone-500">
            조건에 맞는 책을 최대 3권 추천해요. 완독·중단한 책은 제외해요.
          </p>
          <button
            type="submit"
            :disabled="busy"
            class="inline-flex min-h-11 w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full border-none bg-stone-900 px-4 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-white disabled:cursor-wait disabled:opacity-60">
            <span
              x-show="busy"
              x-cloak
              class="i-lucide-loader-circle h-4 w-4 animate-spin"
              aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span x-text="busy ? '책을 고르고 있어요…' : '책 골라보기'">책 골라보기</span>
          </button>
          <p
            x-show="requestFailed"
            x-cloak
            role="alert"
            class="m-0 text-sm leading-6 text-rose-700">
            연결이 원활하지 않아요. 잠시 후 다시 시도해 주세요.
          </p>
        </form>
        <div
          id="book-recommendation-results"
          aria-live="polite"
          aria-atomic="true"
          class="mt-5 empty:mt-0"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </dialog>
</div>
